{
"idioms":{"theme":"Travel and places","items":[
{"t":"off the beaten track","uz":"turistlar kam boradigan, chekka joy","ex":"We found a village off the beaten track.","use":"Part 2: qiziqarli joy"},
{"t":"hit the road","uz":"yo'lga chiqmoq","ex":"We hit the road at six in the morning.","use":"Sayohat hikoyasi"},
{"t":"travel light","uz":"kam yuk bilan sayohat qilmoq","ex":"I always travel light — just one backpack.","use":"Sayohat odatlari"},
{"t":"in the middle of nowhere","uz":"hech narsa yo'q chekka joyda","ex":"Our car broke down in the middle of nowhere.","use":"Hikoya, joy tasviri"},
{"t":"a home from home","uz":"o'z uyidek qulay joy","ex":"The guesthouse was a real home from home.","use":"Mehmonxona, joy maqtovi"},
{"t":"catch the travel bug","uz":"sayohatga mehr qo'ymoq","ex":"I caught the travel bug after my first trip abroad.","use":"Hobbi haqida"},
{"t":"a tourist trap","uz":"turistlardan ko'p pul oladigan joy","ex":"That restaurant is a total tourist trap.","use":"Salbiy tavsif"},
{"t":"get away from it all","uz":"hamma narsadan uzoqlashib dam olmoq","ex":"I go to the mountains to get away from it all.","use":"Dam olish"},
{"t":"the trip of a lifetime","uz":"hayotdagi eng ajoyib sayohat","ex":"Visiting Japan was the trip of a lifetime.","use":"Part 2: sayohat"},
{"t":"feel at home","uz":"o'zini uyidagidek his qilmoq","ex":"The locals made us feel at home.","use":"Odamlar, mehmondo'stlik"}]},
"reading":{"items":[
{"w":"comment","pos":"noun/verb","syn":"remark, observation","uz":"izoh; fikr bildirmoq","ex":"The minister declined to comment."},
{"w":"compensate","pos":"verb","syn":"make up for, offset; pay","uz":"o'rnini to'ldirmoq; tovon to'lamoq","ex":"Nothing can compensate for lost time."},
{"w":"component","pos":"noun","syn":"part, element, piece","uz":"tarkibiy qism","ex":"The engine has over 200 components."},
{"w":"consent","pos":"noun/verb","syn":"permission, agreement; agree","uz":"rozilik","ex":"Parents must give written consent."},
{"w":"considerable","pos":"adj","syn":"significant, substantial, large","uz":"ancha katta","ex":"The plan received considerable support."},
{"w":"constant","pos":"adj","syn":"continuous, steady, unchanging","uz":"doimiy","ex":"The room is kept at a constant temperature."},
{"w":"constrain","pos":"verb","syn":"limit, restrict, hold back","uz":"cheklamoq","ex":"Growth was constrained by a lack of water."},
{"w":"contribute to","pos":"verb","syn":"add to, play a part in, lead to","uz":"…ga hissa qo'shmoq","ex":"Smoking contributes to heart disease."},
{"w":"convention","pos":"noun","syn":"custom, norm; agreement","uz":"odat, qoida; konvensiya","ex":"By convention, the oldest person speaks first."},
{"w":"coordinate","pos":"verb","syn":"organise, manage, arrange","uz":"muvofiqlashtirmoq","ex":"The UN coordinated the rescue effort."}]},
"speaking":{"theme":"Part 2: starting and finishing well","items":[
{"s":"I'd like to talk about …","uz":"Men … haqida gapirmoqchiman","ex":"I'd like to talk about a trip I took to Bukhara.","use":"Part 2 ning birinchi gapi"},
{"s":"This is something/someone I … quite recently.","uz":"Bu yaqinda … qilgan narsa/odam","ex":"This is a book I read quite recently.","use":"Vaqtni tez berish"},
{"s":"Let me start by saying …","uz":"… deyishdan boshlay","ex":"Let me start by saying where it is.","use":"Tuzilma ko'rsatish"},
{"s":"As for (who/where/when) …","uz":"…ga kelsak,","ex":"As for when it happened, it was last summer.","use":"Kartadagi bandlarni ketma-ket yoritish"},
{"s":"The reason I chose this is …","uz":"Buni tanlashimning sababi …","ex":"The reason I chose this is that it changed my mind.","use":"'explain why' qismi"},
{"s":"Anyway, to cut a long story short, …","uz":"Xullas, gapni qisqa qilsam, …","ex":"Anyway, to cut a long story short, we missed the train.","use":"Hikoyani yakunlashga o'tish"},
{"s":"All in all, …","uz":"Umuman olganda, …","ex":"All in all, it was an unforgettable experience.","use":"Part 2 xulosasi"},
{"s":"So that's why …","uz":"Shuning uchun …","ex":"So that's why it means so much to me.","use":"Eng oxirgi gap"},
{"s":"Oh, and one more thing, …","uz":"Ha, yana bir narsa, …","ex":"Oh, and one more thing, the food was amazing.","use":"Vaqt qolsa — 2 daqiqani to'ldirish"},
{"s":"I'd definitely recommend it to anyone who …","uz":"Uni … har kimga albatta tavsiya qilaman","ex":"I'd definitely recommend it to anyone who loves history.","use":"Joy/kitob/film haqida yakun"}]},
"pron":{"theme":"Stress moves in word families","items":[
{"w":"economy – economic – economics","ipa":"/ɪˈkɒnəmi/ – /ˌiːkəˈnɒmɪk/ – /ˌiːkəˈnɒmɪks/","uz":"urg'u ko'chadi: e-CO-no-my, e-co-NO-mic","tip":"-ic qo'shimchasidan oldingi bo'g'in urg'uli"},
{"w":"photograph – photographer","ipa":"/ˈfəʊtəɡrɑːf/ – /fəˈtɒɡrəfə/","uz":"PHO-to-graph → pho-TO-gra-pher","tip":"-er/-y qo'shilsa urg'u ko'chadi"},
{"w":"politics – political – politician","ipa":"/ˈpɒlətɪks/ – /pəˈlɪtɪkl/ – /ˌpɒləˈtɪʃn/","uz":"PO-li-tics, po-LI-ti-cal, po-li-TI-cian","tip":"-ian dan oldingi bo'g'in urg'uli"},
{"w":"educate – education","ipa":"/ˈedʒukeɪt/ – /ˌedʒuˈkeɪʃn/","uz":"-tion dan oldingi bo'g'in urg'uli","tip":"E-du-cate, e-du-CA-tion"},
{"w":"communicate – communication","ipa":"/kəˈmjuːnɪkeɪt/ – /kəˌmjuːnɪˈkeɪʃn/","uz":"urg'u -tion oldiga ko'chadi","tip":"com-mu-ni-CA-tion"},
{"w":"analyse – analysis – analytical","ipa":"/ˈænəlaɪz/ – /əˈnæləsɪs/ – /ˌænəˈlɪtɪkl/","uz":"uchala so'zda urg'u har xil","tip":"A-na-lyse, a-NA-ly-sis, a-na-LY-ti-cal"},
{"w":"technology – technological","ipa":"/tekˈnɒlədʒi/ – /ˌteknəˈlɒdʒɪkl/","uz":"tech-NO-lo-gy, tech-no-LO-gi-cal","tip":"-ical oldidan urg'u"},
{"w":"develop – development","ipa":"/dɪˈveləp/ – /dɪˈveləpmənt/","uz":"urg'u o'zgarmaydi: de-VE-lop","tip":"-ment urg'uni ko'chirmaydi"},
{"w":"comfort – comfortable","ipa":"/ˈkʌmfət/ – /ˈkʌmftəbl/","uz":"urg'u 1-bo'g'inda qoladi","tip":"-able ko'pincha ko'chirmaydi"},
{"w":"public – publicity","ipa":"/ˈpʌblɪk/ – /pʌbˈlɪsəti/","uz":"-ity dan oldingi bo'g'in urg'uli","tip":"PUB-lic, pub-LI-ci-ty"}]},
"task1":{"theme":"Pie charts: shares","items":[
{"w":"make up","syn":"account for, constitute, represent","uz":"tashkil etmoq","ex":"Rent made up 35% of monthly costs."},
{"w":"the largest share","syn":"the biggest proportion","uz":"eng katta ulush","ex":"Coal had the largest share of energy production."},
{"w":"the smallest segment","syn":"the lowest proportion","uz":"eng kichik bo'lak","ex":"The smallest segment was 'other', at 3%."},
{"w":"comprised","syn":"consisted of","uz":"…dan iborat edi","ex":"The budget comprised five categories."},
{"w":"was split between","syn":"was divided among","uz":"… o'rtasida taqsimlandi","ex":"The rest was split between gas and oil."},
{"w":"was equal to","syn":"was the same as","uz":"…ga teng edi","ex":"Spending on food was equal to that on transport."},
{"w":"the remaining","syn":"the rest","uz":"qolgan","ex":"The remaining 10% came from wind."},
{"w":"grew to account for","syn":"increased its share to","uz":"ulushi …gacha oshdi","ex":"Online sales grew to account for a fifth of the total."},
{"w":"in descending order","syn":"from highest to lowest","uz":"kamayish tartibida","ex":"In descending order, the shares were 40%, 30% and 20%."},
{"w":"a combined total of","syn":"together","uz":"birgalikda jami","ex":"Gas and oil had a combined total of 55%."}]},
"task2":{"theme":"Science and space","items":[
{"w":"scientific breakthrough","syn":"major discovery","uz":"ilmiy yutuq","ex":"Vaccines were a major scientific breakthrough."},
{"w":"space exploration","syn":"space research","uz":"kosmosni tadqiq etish","ex":"Space exploration is extremely expensive."},
{"w":"a waste of resources","syn":"misuse of money","uz":"resurslarni behuda sarflash","ex":"Some see space programmes as a waste of resources."},
{"w":"pressing problems","syn":"urgent issues","uz":"dolzarb muammolar","ex":"Money should go to pressing problems like poverty."},
{"w":"cutting-edge research","syn":"advanced research","uz":"eng ilg'or tadqiqotlar","ex":"Universities need funds for cutting-edge research."},
{"w":"ethical concerns","syn":"moral issues","uz":"axloqiy muammolar","ex":"Genetic engineering raises ethical concerns."},
{"w":"spin-off technologies","syn":"by-products of research","uz":"yon mahsulot texnologiyalar","ex":"GPS is a spin-off of space research."},
{"w":"animal testing","syn":"animal experimentation","uz":"hayvonlarda sinov","ex":"Animal testing should be strictly limited."},
{"w":"fund research","syn":"finance studies","uz":"tadqiqotlarni moliyalashtirmoq","ex":"Governments should fund medical research."},
{"w":"advance human knowledge","syn":"increase understanding","uz":"insoniyat bilimini oshirmoq","ex":"Pure research advances human knowledge."}]}
}
